 "notes": [
  "Posted 7 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Posted objective 'Set your course for hell/Whatever' dested Set Your Course For Alderaan / The Ultimate Power In The Universe: the strategy says 'Now he plays Set your course too', and the deck runs Alderaan and the Death Star sites.",
  "The strategy gives the start: the objective, podracing (Start Your Engines!, Boonta Eve Podrace, Sebulba's Podracer, Tatooine: Podrace Arena) with Watto's Box as the starting effect; all are counted in their sections.",
  "Two-sided generic cards dested the Dark pages: Alderaan (Dark), Boonta Eve Podrace (Dark), Death Star: Docking Bay 327 (Dark), Tatooine: Podrace Arena (Dark), Trooper Sabacc (Dark). 'Darth Maul' dested the Tatooine Darth Maul; '3270 to 1' dested 3,720 To 1.",
  "The description says 'Thats the deck that won Origins' (Origins 2001) without naming who played it or giving the list played, so the deck stays general. The strategy also mentions 3-0 in an unnamed event in the Netherlands.",
